 {"acceptance_criteria": "Either (a) the act leg reproduces green for this repo at HEAD eeec1a8 with the failing test named from its own log when it is red, or (b) the act cell is marked harness-untrusted for ai_plays_poke (the CI-command-direct fallback used instead) so QA ticks stop grading it and stop filing product rows from it. GATE ARM: reproduce the act leg on a fresh bunker agent with `bash ~/.hermes/scripts/bunker-qa.sh launch /home/kara/ai_plays_poke` and read the act cell log; expect either arm (a) — exit 0 with the CI pytest command green — or arm (b) recorded as an explicit harness-untrusted marker in the battery configuration, and state which arm holds in worker_summary.", "complexity": 2, "created_at": "2026-11-18T03:09:42.431190Z", "detail": "Tick ai-plays-poke-qa-2026-11-18-02-23-05 (JIT agent 61d46aad @ bunker-mvp), clean clone at HEAD eeec1a8a8028e863b8847494a9425712447ab2dc. Cells ci-pass=FAIL / ci-act=UNVERIFIED: act -j test failed at the Main Test step (rc=1) after ~59s with -x fail-fast; ci.log recorded 'Failure - Main Test' but no step stdout, so no failing test could be named from the harness log. Independent attribution on the same synced tree and the same agent: python -m pytest tests/ -x -q --tb=short --timeout=30 -m 'not live' --ignore=tests/test_live_demo.py --ignore=tests/test_phase4_integration.py --ignore=tests/test_vision_integration.py --deselect=tests/test_edge_cases.py::TestROMHandling::test_rom_path_with_spaces --cov=src --cov-fail-under=75 => 4763 passed, 21 skipped, 4 deselected in 208.23s, TOTAL coverage 85.65% (>= 75%), rc=0. Hosted CI run 44222609720 at the same sha = success. Mechanism recurs at a 4th HEAD (QA-11 mypy false-red, QA-19, QA-23 premise refuted at 87e127f, QA-24 duplicate); the act leg is still not a product signal for this repo. No product defect inferred and no worker should be dispatched from this red.", "foreman_note": "Recurrence of QA-AI-PLAYS-POKE-23 (complete); also see QA-11/QA-19 (act-leg false-reds)